1
00:00:00,286 --> 00:00:02,386
(Howard:)You have any idea
what you're getting

2
00:00:02,388 --> 00:00:03,788
(Howard:)Sheldon for his birthday?

3
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:05,960
(Raj:)He's been fascinated
with dinosaurs lately.

4
00:00:05,959 --> 00:00:07,329
(Raj:)Maybe we could get him a fossil.

5
00:00:07,327 --> 00:00:09,327
(Leonard:)Well, just don't
get anything Jurassic.

6
00:00:09,329 --> 00:00:12,799
(Leonard:)He feels like that whole chunk
of time has gone Hollywood.

7
00:00:14,434 --> 00:00:16,734
(Leonard:)Hey, uh, you know,

8
00:00:16,736 --> 00:00:19,406
(Leonard:)he told a sad story
about how his sister

9
00:00:19,405 --> 00:00:22,705
(Leonard:)tricked him into thinking Batman
was coming to his party.

10
00:00:22,709 --> 00:00:24,039
(Howard:)That's funny.

11
00:00:24,043 --> 00:00:25,813
(Howard:)Let's do that.

12
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:29,310
(Leonard:)Maybe we could get Batman
to actually show up.

13
00:00:29,315 --> 00:00:31,915
(Raj:)You mean, some guy
in a lame suit?

14
00:00:31,918 --> 00:00:34,188
(Leonard:)Or a real Batman.
Hey, Stuart?

15
00:00:34,187 --> 00:00:36,757
(Leonard:)Didn't you try to get Adam West
to do a signing here once?

16
00:00:36,756 --> 00:00:39,256
(Stuart:)Yeah, but there was kind of
a scheduling conflict.

17
00:00:39,258 --> 00:00:42,198
(Stuart:)He, uh, wanted to know
when he'd get paid.

18
00:00:42,195 --> 00:00:44,125
(Stuart:)And I wouldn't tell him.

19
00:00:45,598 --> 00:00:47,528
(Leonard:)Can I get his contact info?

20
00:00:47,533 --> 00:00:49,933
(Stuart:)Sure, uh, but
just so you know,

21
00:00:49,936 --> 00:00:51,266
(Stuart:)he's kind of a diva.

22
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:53,140
(Leonard:)He is?
Oh, yeah.

23
00:00:53,139 --> 00:00:54,239
(Stuart:)Won't take the bus.

24
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,540
(Stuart:)He won't pack his own lunch.

25
00:00:55,541 --> 00:01:01,021
(Stuart:)Won't let you spend
the night on his couch.

